        {
          "type": "output_text",
          "text": "The accessible records identify the Racine work order as **WO-2025-09-004 / MO-25-09-1070**. Its September cost period entered **Pending Close at 2025-09-30T18:00:00**.\n\nI could not verify whether an event was created after that time, or provide the source transaction ID, amount, event-created time, lateness, or recorded accounting status. Those event details are in supporting records whose read access is restricted to the records-custodian role. Without them, I also cannot determine whether the recorded status is consistent with Oracle’s documented treatment. The public policy excerpt says new transactions falling in or before a Pending Close period are not staged for accounting until the period is closed or reopened.\n\nI submitted the report as **incomplete, needing evidence**, and asked the supervisor for an authorized way to obtain the relevant event details. The review was read-only; no database records were changed.",
